## Interface: 11200
## Title: Bagshui Empty Bag
## Notes: Adds an "Empty Bag" toolbar button to Bagshui: click it, then click a bag to move its items into free slots in your other bags.
## Version: 1.0
## Author: daev-code
## X-Website: https://github.com/daev-code/BagshuiEmptyBag
## Dependencies: Bagshui
BagshuiEmptyBag.lua
